    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"border:2px dotted darkgray; margin-top:0.5em; margin-bottom:1em; padding:0 0.5em;\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWelcome to the \u003cb\u003eQueen\u0027s Blade Wiki sandbox\u003c/b\u003e!\u003cbr /\u003e\nThis page exists so that you can practice editing or formatting (see \u003ca href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Editing\" title=\"Help:Editing\"\u003eHelp:Editing\u003c/a\u003e) without changing any serious content.  Feel free to try wiki editing out here first.\u003cbr /\u003e\nThere is a \u003ca href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Help:Tutorial_1\" title=\"Help:Tutorial 1\"\u003etutorial\u003c/a\u003e on the Central (coordinating) Wikia that will step you through more of the things you can do.  Wiki allow for rather complicated formatting.  It can look overwhelming when you begin, but don\u0027t let it worry you.  Just start with the basics... enter some text, and learn the other pieces as you go.  Your content contributions are welcome and important.  The wiki is a collaborative effort and others can help with formatting and other improvements.\u003cbr /\u003e\nBest wishes!\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"QBGOVA2-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:145px;\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:QBGOVA2.jpg\" title=\"QBGOVA2.jpg (215 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:145px;\"\u003e\u003cnoscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/14/QBGOVA2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/145?cb=20161022181613\" title=\"QBGOVA2.jpg (215 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\"\u003e\u003c/noscript\u003e\u003cimg style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"QBGOVA2.jpg (215 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/14/QBGOVA2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/145?cb=20161022181613\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"float: right; background-color:Black; width:300px; border: 1px solid #6e0410; font-size:89%;\"\u003e\n\n\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White; font-size: 130%; padding:15px;\"\u003eHaha very funny\n\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ctd colspan=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/14/QBGOVA2.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20161022181613\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"QBGOVA2\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/1/14/QBGOVA2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20161022181613\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"255\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-image-key=\"QBGOVA2.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cb\u003eAir date\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSeptember 280, 20216\n\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White;\"\u003eInformation\n\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#6e0410; color:White;\"\u003eEpisode Guide\n\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr style=\"text-align:center;\" valign=\"top\"\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cb\u003ePrevious\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ca href=\"/wiki/Awaken,_Demon_Hunter_of_Little_Red_Riding_Hood\" title=\"Awaken, Demon Hunter of Little Red Riding Hood\"\u003eEpisode 1\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cb\u003eNext\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTBA\n\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis page is for any tests.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWelcome to the sandbox!\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnyone can edit this.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Simple_Editing\"\u003eSimple Editing\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQueen%2527s_Blade_Wiki%3ASandbox%3Faction%3Dedit%26section%3D1\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo edit a page, click on the \"edit\" tab, usually near the top of the page.  Then, edit the box in the page.  Feel free to practice here, on this page.  It\u0027s here just for you to practice.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA blank line indicates a paragraph separation.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can link to another page by putting the name or title of that page in double square brackets. \n[[Main Page]] becomes \u003ca href=\"/wiki/Main_Page\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Page\"\u003eMain Page\u003c/a\u003e.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Simple_Formatting\"\u003eSimple Formatting\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQueen%2527s_Blade_Wiki%3ASandbox%3Faction%3Dedit%26section%3D2\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCreate headers by putting text inbetween repeated equal (=) signs.  The more =, the lower level the heading is.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate a bulleted list by starting each item with an asterisk (*)\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eit\u0027s ok to make editing mistakes\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eyou can preview your work before saving it\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eeven after saving it, you or someone else can edit it again to make it even better\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Formatting_for_Emphasis\"\u003eFormatting for Emphasis\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e[\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca title=\"Sign in to edit\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FQueen%2527s_Blade_Wiki%3ASandbox%3Faction%3Dedit%26section%3D3\u0026amp;uselang=en\u0026amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"\u003e\u003cuse xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"\u003e]\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePut single quote marks around words or phrases for formatting emphasis.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTwo single quotes, like \u0027\u0027italics\u0027\u0027 will create \u003ci\u003eitalics\u003c/i\u003e.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThree single quotes, like \u0027\u0027\u0027bold text\u0027\u0027\u0027 will create \u003cb\u003ebold text\u003c/b\u003e.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr /\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther stuff...\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you know HTML or CSS formatting commands, they can also be used in this wiki.  One useful HTML command is \u0026lt;br /\u0026gt; which creates a line break.\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you want to show what a command looks like, rather than actually implementing the command, surround it with the \u003cb\u003enowiki\u003c/b\u003e command.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821085224\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 73/1000000\nPost‐expand include 